# Dependencies and build output — reinstalled/rebuilt inside the image.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.angular
**/coverage

# Catalog builder cache (raw Openverse pages + URL verification results).
# Regenerated by shop/tools/build-catalog.mjs; never needed at runtime.
**/.cache
tools/

# Screenshots and other local scratch output.
**/.screenshots

# Secrets — the image gets its configuration from the environment.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

# Docs and local-only compose; changing them should not bust the build cache.
CONTRACT.md
README.md
docker-compose.dev.yml
Dockerfile
.dockerignore

# Misc
**/*.log
**/.DS_Store
**/.git
**/.gitignore
**/.vscode
**/.idea
